<section class="evidence-band signal-chain-dossier" aria-labelledby="inventory-boundary-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>RECORD BOUNDARY</p>
      <h2 id="inventory-boundary-heading">THE PUBLIC DOSSIER DOCUMENTS THE SYSTEM, NOT THE HOUSEHOLD.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li>
        <h3>LOCAL CORE</h3>
        <p>The loopback instrument stores runtime JSON, attached photographs, locations, counterparties, fulfillment evidence, and audit history outside the public tree.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>SLUSH AUTHORITY</h3>
        <p>SLUSH remains the private authority for cleared liquid movements. L'Inventaire may attribute an evidenced per-item result; it does not declare the cash position.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>SHARED INSTRUMENT</h3>
        <p>L'Inventaire and <a href="/rd/">Le Laboratoire</a> use one local data and API core while preserving distinct jurisdictions.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
